        "caption": "The overview of RAMSES. The input is a biomedical context and multiple related studies that are encoded by two different BIOBERT models. Then we compute the relevance score of each document conditioned by the context. Finally, the top-k most salient documents are concatenated with the context and given to BART that marginalizes their token probability distribution, weighted by the relevance scores, at decoding time.",
