        "caption": "GPU usage: This panel shows the GPU memory consumption during training of the QA-GNN architecture with the three message-passing methods and \"mean\" as aggregation operator. With its attention-based mechanism, the Gat-Conv model is the most expensive in both memory requirements and training time. These experiments have been carried out using an NVIDIA RTX 3090 GPU with 24 GB memory and batch size 64.",
